G.128. lul-e-eš ba-ab-ŋar-ra tum₉-e ba-ab-tur-ra-am₃
#tr.en: and they have been eroded by the winds!
#lem: lul[false]; ŋar[put]; tumu[wind]; tur[small]
#etcsl: line-id=G.128

G.129. lu₂-erim₂-e %e ka-na-aŋ₂-ŋu₁₀ %s ib₂-til-la
#tr.en: They are making a lament for me of how the foe has finished off my Land!
#lem: luʾerim[evildoer]; kanaŋ[land]N; til[complete]
#etcsl: line-id=G.129

G.130. er₂-ra %e ma-a-ar %s ma-an-ŋa₂-ŋa₂-ne-am₃
