#etcsl: line-id=G.130

G.131. šag₄ %e aŋ₂-gig-ga %s ib₂-dirig-ŋu₁₀ ad-bi-še₃ ba-ab-be₂-ne ib₂-sed₄-de₃-ne-am₃
