#lem: Išmedagan[1]RN; inim[word]; su[flesh]; dug[good]
#etcsl: line-id=T.308

T.309. saŋ us₂-a-ni šag₄-ga dug₄-ga-ni in-de₃-ŋen-na-am₃
#tr.en: @wDN{Enlil's} constant attendant, with whose thoughts he agrees!
#lem: saŋ[head]; us[accompany]; šag[heart]; dug[speak]; ŋen[go]
#etcsl: line-id=T.309

T.310. sun₅-na šita-ba ki la₂-a-ne₂-eš₂ ŋiri₃-ba sig₁₀-ga-ne₂-eš₂
#tr.en: Because the humble one prostrated himself in his devotions and served there,
#lem: sun[humble]; šita[prayer]; ki[place]; la[hang]; ŋiri[foot]; sig[put into]
#etcsl: line-id=T.310

T.311. sizkur-ra u₃-gul ŋa₂-ŋa₂-da-ne₂-eš₂ giri₁₇ ki su-bu-da-ne₂-eš₂
#tr.en: because he will entreat him in supplication and will do obeisance,
#lem: siškur[prayer]; ugul[cvne]; ŋar[put]; kiri[nose]; ki[place]; sub[rub]
#etcsl: line-id=T.311

T.312. |KI.LUGAL.GUB| til₃-le-da ni₂ teŋ₃-ŋe₂₆-da-ne₂-eš₂ gur-gur-re-da-ne₂-eš₂
