#etcsl: line-id=T.313

T.314. nam-nun-na mu sud-su₃-ra₂-ni e-ne-er in-na-an-dug₄-ga-am₃
#tr.en: @wDN{Enlil} has promised to @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}} his dominion of extended years!
#lem: namnun[magnificence]; mu[year]; sud[distant]; ane[he]; dug[speak]
#etcsl: line-id=T.314

T.315. lu₂ nam-lugal-la saŋ-bi-še₃ e₃-a e-ne-er in-na-an-dug₄-ga-am₃
