#lem: lugal[king]; bala[turn]; sag[good]; ane[he]; dug[speak]
#etcsl: line-id=T.316

T.317. uŋ₃ ki-tuš ne-ha bi₂-in-dur₂-ru-na e-ne-er in-na-an-dug₄-ga-am₃
#tr.en: He promised him that he shall have the people inhabit safe dwellings!
#lem: uŋ[people]; kituš[dwelling place]; neha[calm]; durun[sit]; ane[he]; dug[speak]
#etcsl: line-id=T.317

T.318. uŋ₃ šar₂-ra niŋ₂ bi₂-in-dug₄-ga-a in-de₃-a-ŋen-na-am₃
#tr.en: @wDN{Enlil} found agreement in what he had said to the numerous people!
